// was hit (the axis with the smaller penetration), or both on a diagonal hit,
// and pushes the ball back outside the brick so it cannot re-collide next frame
// (sticky bounce). Because the ball is pushed out, a seam where the ball spans
// two bricks in the same pass only bounces once.
function resolveBounce(ball, brick) {
